      "value": "Update: I didn't realize there had been another post similar to mine but it's also worth reading here:\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/can-bilibilicom-be-added-into-whitelist-of-vrc-video-player\n\nI hope this will be considered in a new update in the future. Thank you",
