  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "(Before anything, this is a feature request but also includes a bug)\n\nFirst I'd like to say that on VRChat's official website, they say that Youku links are whitelisted for video player: https://creators.vrchat.com/worlds/udon/video-players/www-whitelist/\n\nWell, this is broken and videos from Youku don't work on VRChat. I don't know when this broke but it doesn't matter. Because luckily for you, ZERO people use this! Add Bilibili instead! :D\n\nhttps://www.bilibili.com/\n\nIn China, Youku is what older generations used to watch videos and was popular a decade ago or more. But everyone knows that Youku is miserable to use because there are too many ads and not much new content nowadays aside from movies. I don't really know why this website was whitelisted in the first place...\n\nChinese people use Bilibili now which is like the equivalent to YouTube. I highly suggest whitelisting this instead. Bilibili is more prevalent and it'll make it easier so that we don't have to find workarounds to watch videos together anymore.",
